//! `div_2x1_mg10(u1, u0)` computes the exact floor quotient
//! `floor((u1 * 2^16 + u0) / D)` for all `u1 < D` and `u0 < 2^16` using only
//! shifts, bitwise masks, and `u64` multiplications (without hardware `/` or `%`
//! in the core reciprocal step).

use crate::constants::*;
